<p> 2   Consol Rutile	    3.21   0.72</p>
<p> 3   Holyman		    4.96   1.70</p>
<p> 4   Renison Goldflds	 5.40   3.68</p>
<p> 5   Haoma Mining	     5.67   0.28</p>
<p> 6   Jardine Fm China	 6.08   0.90</p>
